'''Chub''' is a [[boss]] that can appear in the {{s|Caves}} and the {{s|Flooded Caves}}.

== Behavior ==
Chub moves randomly around the room in cardinal directions and can perform the following attacks:
* Charges at Isaac whenever she lines up with one of her cardinal directions.
** Chub eats any {{e|Bomb}}s dropped in her path; stunning her for a moment before dealing considerable damage.
* Spawns 1-2 {{e|Charger}}s, up to a maximum of 5 (occasionally 6 if she spawns 2 while there are 4 alive).
** Chub's charge attack can damage and kill any Chargers.
Chub deals a whole heart of contact damage.

== Champion Versions {{unlockable}} ==
: {{bc|7}}: 15% larger and slower than normal, with 25% more HP (437.5). Spawns {{dlc|nr}}Black/{{dlc|r}}Orange-coloured {{e|Boil}}s instead of Chargers. Despite the different color, they behave exactly like normal Boils. (Note that this actually looks green in-game, but internally it is labeled as blue. This is because yellow mixes with blue to cause green.)
: {{bc|6}}: 15% smaller and faster than normal, with 15% less HP (297.5). Spawns {{e|Spitty|text=Spitties}} instead of Chargers.

